{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc31 <strong>Meow Path 2</strong> <strong>An adorable puzzle adventure that will keep you hooked!</strong> Draw lines to cover every area in the world of cute kitties, but beware! Various obstacles are ready to challenge your puzzle-solving skills.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What You'll Experience</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>125+ carefully crafted levels</strong> with intricate design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>500+ side levels</strong> for challenge seekers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More challenging and mentally engaging than the first game </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 adorable cat characters</strong> with unique designs and random selection system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>500+ cat image collection</strong> that will captivate you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10+ types of obstacles</strong> in <strong>20+ different patterns</strong> for unique challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meticulously designed paths that never feel repetitive, both challenging and relaxing at the same time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No language during gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Level Editor</strong> - Create your own levels and share files with friends!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725130/extras/caa543210a02ce3183f23ca3bff758bc.poster.avif?t=1755178778\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725130/extras/caa543210a02ce3183f23ca3bff758bc.webm?t=1755178778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725130/extras/caa543210a02ce3183f23ca3bff758bc.mp4?t=1755178778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready for an adventure with the kitties in &quot;Meow Path 2&quot;\u00a0</strong>A puzzle game that will challenge your planning and problem-solving abilities while delivering endless cute and entertaining experiences!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\ud83c\udf1f Start your adventure and unlock the secrets of the cat world! \ud83c\udf1f</i></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Tiny Meow Steps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3725130/70726405208db025a93b202afae0b3cf088ecc8f.jpg"},{"name":"Kitten's Warm-up","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3725130/56f75d21c31bcf887890b65ed8736fdf2389be5e.jpg"},{"name":"Paw by Paw","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3725130/f48282f7db9472f887bf1b075d39daaf74ebe7ea.jpg"},{"name":"Brave Little Furball","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3725130/869e51d6ec0d44e5bedb629e610072c11929e567.jpg"},{"name":"Meowgineer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3725130/de67c8a5090ff2a6f4f3abab4e32f5ddc4588894.jpg"},{"name":"Paw-sitive Progress","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3725130/55a72e5ab455d6c698a73e506024addbca5d2d7d.jpg"},{"name":"Whisker Warp! 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3725130/bcdb77e16b64f427611f3ecb0d3b8ca422171663.jpg"},{"name":"Whisker Warp! 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3725130/bcdb77e16b64f427611f3ecb0d3b8ca422171663.jpg"},{"name":"Whisker Warp! 3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3725130/bcdb77e16b64f427611f3ecb0d3b8ca422171663.jpg"},{"name":"Start Over, Aga